      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... the \"different kind of quiet\" sounds like it takes so much work. and i'm just tired. it's like, if everything is so big and i'm so small, doesn't it just make sense that things would just... settle? like the dust eventually just stops floating and falls? it feels like it would be so much more natural than constantly trying to stay afloat.",
